   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer, 32 GB or more). MiniMax-H3-Image needs ComfyUI 0.45 or newer. The workflow edits Picture 1 with Picture 2 as a second reference, in 6 steps at cfg 1 on ComfyUI's simple scheduler. The prompt names the images as Picture 1 and Picture 2. With width and height at 0 the result takes the size of Picture 1 as the VAE sees it, its short side scaled into 1024 to 2048 pixels. Each picture must be between 1:3 and 3:1 in shape. Read the model's license before you use the images: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/images.html#licenses\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull minimax-h3-image\n\nPut reference-1.png and reference-2.png in ComfyUI's input folder, or pick other images in the Picture nodes.\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
